{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Return one cached product and any stored cross-marketplace offers. safe_id is the provider-qualified permalink ID, or a provider-less eBay ID. Unknown IDs return 404; removed public products return 410. Unavailable fields may be null. Each offer entry is one marketplace: its matched hits and last_checked, when we last checked that marketplace (ISO 8601). A hit includes in_stock: true only when its stock was confirmed. eBay listings also carry `shipping` (last-seen shipping cost and delivery window) and `return_terms` (returns accepted, window in days, who pays return postage); `gtin` appears when the listing's barcode passes its check digit. Cache-only.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"safe_id":{"description":"A product permalink id, e.g. amazon~~B0G2BFZRGL or the provider-less eBay form v1~158082631449~0 \u2014 the id of an entry from /api/public/products or of a product from /api/public/search (MCP tools lianex_products, lianex_search).","type":"string"}},"required":["safe_id"],"type":"object"},"name":"lianex_product_by_safe_id","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"ProductResponse":{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"availability":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"brand":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"browse_name":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"browse_slug":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"canonical_specs":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}]},"category_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"category_name":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"condition":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"currency":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"gtin":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"id":{"type":"string"},"image":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"